WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.352
Poppy was out of gas.

2
00:00:09.353 --> 00:00:12.958
"I can't move!" she said.

3
00:00:12.959 --> 00:00:21.801
"Uh-oh," said Eddy.

4
00:00:21.802 --> 00:00:25.585
Poppy moaned.

5
00:00:25.586 --> 00:00:29.642
"This is bad!"

6
00:00:29.643 --> 00:00:35.044
Ms. Fender drove over.

7
00:00:35.045 --> 00:00:38.613
"Poppy," said Ms. Fender.

8
00:00:38.614 --> 00:00:41.498
"I told you to stop playing.

9
00:00:41.499 --> 00:00:43.964
You didn't listen!"

10
00:00:43.965 --> 00:00:48.887
Poppy looked at the ground.

11
00:00:48.888 --> 00:00:54.649
Jeb pushed her to the garage.

12
00:00:54.650 --> 00:01:08.791
Everyone followed.

13
00:01:08.792 --> 00:01:17.339
Ms. Fender put out the smoke.

14
00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:24.636
She gave Poppy a new tire.

15
00:01:24.637 --> 00:01:37.131
Then Poppy filled her gas tank.

16
00:01:37.132 --> 00:01:41.493
"Um, Ms. Fender," said Poppy.

17
00:01:41.494 --> 00:01:43.967
"I'm sorry I didn't listen.

18
00:01:43.968 --> 00:01:47.110
I was busy playing."

19
00:01:47.111 --> 00:01:50.094
"I know," said Ms. Fender.

20
00:01:50.095 --> 00:01:52.869
"But you can't always play.

21
00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:56.127
You must take care of yourself."

22
00:01:56.128 --> 00:02:01.590
"Okay," said Poppy.

23
00:02:01.591 --> 00:02:08.572
Then she raced over to Eddy.

24
00:02:08.573 --> 00:02:11.482
"Tag!" said Poppy.

25
00:02:11.483 --> 00:02:17.613
"You're it!"

